FFmpeg libraries in this folder

avutil, avcodec, avformat, avfilter, swscale and swresample are the unchanged "lgpl" shared
libraries of custom_ffmpeg @CUSTOM_FFMPEG_VERSION@ (FFmpeg @FFMPEG_VERSION@). They are licensed
under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later; the licence texts are in the
licenses folder, and build-info.txt shows how they were configured.

rawreel loads these libraries at run time and is not linked with them. You may replace them with
your own LGPL shared build of FFmpeg that uses the same file names, or delete this folder
(rawreel then opens no container files and no lavfi: graphs). Each library must have the major
version of the one it replaces and at least its minor version (@FFMPEG_LIBRARY_VERSIONS@); an
older one, a GPL build or a non-free build is refused.

The complete corresponding source of the LGPL components (@RAWREEL_LGPL_COMPONENTS@) is in
@RAWREEL_SOURCES_ARCHIVE@, attached to the same release as this package:
https://github.com/BarabashkaD/rawreel/releases/tag/v@RAWREEL_VERSION@
It holds custom_ffmpeg @CUSTOM_FFMPEG_VERSION@ with its submodules and build scripts (the configure
line included)@RAWREEL_LAME_SENTENCE@.
Not included: the AMD AMF public headers (MIT) that avcodec's AMF support is built against; their
URL and SHA256 are in custom_ffmpeg-@CUSTOM_FFMPEG_VERSION@/versions.cmake in that archive.
